sequenceDiagram
 participant Buyer
 participant Agent
 participant Contract
 participant FT as SDD NEP-141
 participant Callback
 Buyer->>Contract: create mandate (buyer-signed)
 Agent->>Contract: create_trade_as_agent(mandate_id)
 Contract->>Contract: validate mandate; reserve budget; store policy snapshot
 Buyer->>FT: ft_transfer_call(trade_id)
 FT->>Contract: ft_on_transfer
 Contract->>Contract: validate buyer and amount; consume reservation
 Note over Contract: Documents and inspection complete
 alt Passing inspection; snapshot permits immediate release
  Agent->>Contract: authorize_release_under_mandate
 else Passing inspection; no immediate agent permission
  Buyer->>Contract: confirm_acceptance
 else Failed inspection; snapshot permits refund
  Agent->>Contract: authorize_refund_under_mandate
 else Failed inspection; no agent refund permission
  Buyer->>Contract: request refund or open dispute
 end
 Contract->>Contract: validate snapshot/state; authorize settlement
 Agent->>Contract: release_payment / refund_escrow (or any caller)
 Contract->>FT: ft_transfer(recipient, amount)
 FT-->>Callback: promise result
 Callback->>Contract: private callback(settlement_id)
 alt transfer succeeds
  Contract->>Contract: mark success; reduce liability; terminal state
 else transfer fails
  Contract->>Contract: mark failed; preserve liability; restore authorization
 end
